   104	of nitric acid ­(HNO3, 65%, Merck, Germany) was added to the tube. The sample was placed at room temperature
   105	overnight to digest slowly. At the next day, 2 ml of 35% hydrogen peroxide ­(H2O2) was added to the tube and
