   188	
   189	Human health risk assessment of HMs via consumption of fish
   190	
   191	Different methods have been used for the determination of the risk associated with the consumption of
   192	contaminated fish. Estimated daily intake is one of the most common methods to help identify the number
   193	of pollutants consumed daily. For determining health risk related to HM via the consumption of fish were
   194	determined by using the following ­indices46,47.
   195	
   196	Estimated daily intake of HMs (EDI)
   197	
   198	Daily intake of HMs via consumption of fish was determined by using the following equation:
   199	
   200	EDI =
